#: ../../operations/costing/cost_dimensions.rst:2
msgid "Cost Dimensions"
msgstr "Kostendimensionen"

#: ../../operations/costing/cost_dimensions.rst:5
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Überblick"

#: ../../operations/costing/cost_dimensions.rst:7
msgid ""
"|morpheus| syncs cost allocation data from cloud providers that support "
"native cost categorization. This data is stored on invoice line items and"
" can be used to filter and group costs in the Time Series Cost report."
msgstr "|morpheus| synchronisiert Kostenzuordnungsdaten von Cloud-Providern, die native Kostenkategorisierung unterstützen. Diese Daten werden auf Rechnungspositionen gespeichert und können zum Filtern und Gruppieren von Kosten im Time-Series-Cost-Bericht verwendet werden."

#: ../../operations/costing/cost_dimensions.rst:9
msgid "Three cost dimensions are available:"
msgstr "Drei Kostendimensionen sind verfügbar:"

#: ../../operations/costing/cost_dimensions.rst:11
msgid ""
"**Cost Project** — maps to the \"Project\" cost category from the cloud "
"provider"
msgstr "**Cost Project** — entspricht der Kostenkategorie „Project“ des Cloud-Providers"

#: ../../operations/costing/cost_dimensions.rst:12
msgid "**Cost Team** — maps to the \"Team\" cost category from the cloud provider"
msgstr "**Cost Team** — entspricht der Kostenkategorie „Team“ des Cloud-Providers"

#: ../../operations/costing/cost_dimensions.rst:13
msgid ""
"**Cost Environment** — maps to the \"Environment\" cost category from the"
" cloud provider"
msgstr "**Cost Environment** — entspricht der Kostenkategorie „Environment“ des Cloud-Providers"

#: ../../operations/costing/cost_dimensions.rst:15
msgid ""
"These dimensions are populated automatically during costing sync. There "
"is no manual configuration of dimension values within |morpheus|—they are"
" derived entirely from cost category data provided by the cloud."
msgstr "Diese Dimensionen werden während der Costing-Sync automatisch befüllt. Es gibt keine manuelle Konfiguration von Dimensionswerten in |morpheus|—sie werden vollständig aus den vom Cloud-Provider bereitgestellten Kostenkategoriedaten abgeleitet."

#: ../../operations/costing/cost_dimensions.rst:18
msgid "Supported Cloud Providers"
msgstr "Unterstützte Cloud-Provider"

#: ../../operations/costing/cost_dimensions.rst:20
msgid "**Amazon Web Services (AWS)**"
msgstr "**Amazon Web Services (AWS)**"

#: ../../operations/costing/cost_dimensions.rst:22
msgid ""
"AWS Cost Categories named \"Project\", \"Team\", and \"Environment\" are "
"synced into the corresponding |morpheus| cost dimensions during the "
"costing sync process. To use cost dimensions with AWS:"
msgstr "AWS Cost Categories mit den Namen „Project“, „Team“ und „Environment“ werden während des Costing-Sync-Prozesses in die entsprechenden |morpheus|-Kostendimensionen synchronisiert. So nutzen Sie Kostendimensionen mit AWS:"

#: ../../operations/costing/cost_dimensions.rst:24
msgid ""
"Configure Cost Categories in the AWS Billing console with category names "
"``Project``, ``Team``, and/or ``Environment``"
msgstr "Konfigurieren Sie Cost Categories in der AWS-Billing-Konsole mit den Kategorienamen ``Project``, ``Team`` und/oder ``Environment``"

#: ../../operations/costing/cost_dimensions.rst:25
msgid ""
"Define rules within each Cost Category to assign cost values (e.g., based"
" on tags, accounts, or services)"
msgstr "Definieren Sie Regeln innerhalb jeder Cost Category, um Kostenwerte zuzuweisen (z. B. basierend auf Tags, Konten oder Services)"

#: ../../operations/costing/cost_dimensions.rst:26
msgid ""
"Enable costing sync in |morpheus| (Infrastructure > Clouds > Edit > set "
"**COSTING** to \"Sync Costing\")"
msgstr "Aktivieren Sie die Costing-Sync in |morpheus| (Infrastructure > Clouds > Edit > setzen Sie **COSTING** auf „Sync Costing“)"

#: ../../operations/costing/cost_dimensions.rst:28
msgid ""
"Once synced, the dimension values appear as filter and Group By options "
"in costing reports."
msgstr "Nach der Synchronisierung erscheinen die Dimensionswerte als Filter- und Group-By-Optionen in Kostenberichten."

#: ../../operations/costing/cost_dimensions.rst:30
msgid "Note"
msgstr "Hinweis"

#: ../../operations/costing/cost_dimensions.rst:30
msgid ""
"Only AWS is currently supported for cost dimension sync. Other cloud "
"providers do not populate these fields."
msgstr "Derzeit wird nur AWS für die Kostendimension-Sync unterstützt. Andere Cloud-Provider befüllen diese Felder nicht."

#: ../../operations/costing/cost_dimensions.rst:33
msgid "Using Cost Dimensions in Reports"
msgstr "Kostendimensionen in Berichten verwenden"

#: ../../operations/costing/cost_dimensions.rst:35
msgid ""
"Cost dimensions are available as **Group By** options in the Time Series "
"Cost report. To use them:"
msgstr "Kostendimensionen sind als **Group By**-Optionen im Time-Series-Cost-Bericht verfügbar. So nutzen Sie sie:"

#: ../../operations/costing/cost_dimensions.rst:37
msgid "Navigate to |OpRep|"
msgstr "Navigieren Sie zu |OpRep|"

#: ../../operations/costing/cost_dimensions.rst:38
msgid "Run a Time Series Cost report"
msgstr "Führen Sie einen Time-Series-Cost-Bericht aus"

#: ../../operations/costing/cost_dimensions.rst:39
msgid ""
"Select **Cost Project**, **Cost Team**, or **Cost Environment** from the "
"**Group By** dropdown"
msgstr "Wählen Sie **Cost Project**, **Cost Team** oder **Cost Environment** aus der Dropdown-Liste **Group By**"

#: ../../operations/costing/cost_dimensions.rst:40
msgid ""
"Optionally use the corresponding filter to limit results to specific "
"dimension values"
msgstr "Optional den entsprechenden Filter verwenden, um Ergebnisse auf bestimmte Dimensionswerte einzugrenzen"

#: ../../operations/costing/cost_dimensions.rst:42
msgid ""
"The full list of Group By options available in the Time Series Cost "
"report:"
